Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:12.36,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,After reincarnating as \Nthe villainess in an otome game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:20.83,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,my engagement was called off \Nat my condemnation event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:25.63,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Then Prince Aquasteed, a character from \Nthe sequel, suddenly showed up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:32.01,Flashback,Aquasteed FB,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, would you be my consort?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:37.38,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Aquasteed Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:42.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's the main route in the sequel to \Nthe otome game {\i0}The Ring of Lapis Lazuli{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:46.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't believe my favorite character \Nproposed to me out of the blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:52.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But why would he propose \Nto me, the villainess?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:59.08,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm just honored that you \Nwere concerned about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:08.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well, it's just... you are \Na favorite among the ladies, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:11.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Does that mean I can \Nget my hopes up a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:18.98,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... Prince Aquasteed, why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,propose to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There is only one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:29.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I wanted you desperately, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:48.61,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:05.96,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\pos(320,123)\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&}Prince Aqua,{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Do You Like {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sugar{\b0}{\c&H343E6B&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:12.21,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I first met Prince Aquasteed \Na year ago at a soirée.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:15.11,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,We were in the same class at the academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:17.26,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but we hadn't really spoken at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,{\t(1229,2230,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:25.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I always watched you \Nfrom the window of the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:30.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? Oh, you mean behind the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. I saw you reading \Nin the shade of a tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:35.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,your expressions constantly changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You looked adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:40.32,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:45.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I was trying to stay out of sight \Nto read and eat sweets with Philine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:47.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,627)}and he saw me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:51.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You looked so serious reading that book,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but then, in the next moment, \Nyou were blushing shyly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.27,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,When I saw tears in your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:59.89,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I wanted so badly to embrace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Please forget about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:03.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:07.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We're finally together. \NPlease let me see more of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:10.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But... I had no idea you \Nwere watching me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:15.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I do apologize if it seems \Nas though I was spying on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:20.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But as I watched you reading \Nunder that tree every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:22.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I became more and more captivated by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So much so that even \NI was surprised with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:32.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But you were engaged \Nto Prince Hartknights,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:37.40,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,and I could never steal \Na foreign prince's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.02,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I intended to keep my feelings to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:44.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,After completing my year \Nof studying abroad, I returned home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:47.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,and told myself to forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.49,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:51.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:55.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I was desperate not to let \Nthat opportunity pass me by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Rather pathetic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.24,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,When I was standing there all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:06.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,your presence was very reassuring!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:11.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I was a bit shocked when Prince Hartknights \Nwent so far as to banish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:15.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Though, if you truly \Nwere to be banished...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:20.16,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,the thought crossed my mind \Nthat I might just take you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:23.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Please don't tease me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I was quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:31.20,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,H-How can he say all this so calmly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Because he's a character in an otome game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:35.73,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Or is it just his personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.73,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.22,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:46.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I still can't believe \Nyou're so fond of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It pains me to hear that you doubt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:54.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I love you so much, \NI just can't contain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:00.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:04.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, \Nit seems we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you for seeing me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:17.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, I'd like \Nto invite you out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.02,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,May I have a bit of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I would love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:24.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I've graduated from the academy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,so I have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:29.25,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Then I'll come for you \Nin three days. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.18,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Her engagement canceled! Banishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:37.50,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,How could that fool say such things \Nto my sweet Tiararose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:41.43,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Imagine casting aside our \Nprecious Lady Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:44.43,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,There is no saving that foolish prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:48.85,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,But I'm glad we learned who that prince \Nreally is while they were still engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:52.07,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,Wasn't Prince Aquasteed just lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:52.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:56.65,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,So, Tiararose, how are you \Ngoing to answer him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:07:00.39,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Your engagement to Prince \NHartknights has been broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:05.46,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,and Prince Aquasteed \Nhas formally asked you to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:11.49,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,How do you feel about Prince \NAquasteed, Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:16.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed is \Nfar more than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A villainess marrying the crown prince \Nof a neighboring country...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:24.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is such a future even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:32.14,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.42,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:37.14,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,His Majesty has ordered me \Nnot to let you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.80,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I won't stay long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.40,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'd just like to see how Akari is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.23,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:47.15,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Please. I've realized that my judgment \Nmay have been mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:55.45,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I need to speak with Akari \Nin order to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.26,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.61,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.37,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I've missed you, Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.18,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,They won't let me leave this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:09.06,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,and there's nothing to do in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.05,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I thought I'd die of boredom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.87,Italics,Hartknights INT,0,0,0,,Boredom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:15.63,Italics,Hartknights INT,0,0,0,,So what happened at the graduation party
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.56,Italics,Hartknights INT,0,0,0,,hasn't been on her mind at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:23.20,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But you know, I never dreamed Prince \NAqua would say that to Lady Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:27.28,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I just hope he isn't deceiving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:32.48,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Akari, was what Tiara said that day true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:34.58,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,That she hasn't done anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:35.49,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:39.13,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I do remember feeling bad \Nbecause she was mean to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:43.90,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But I had you by my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.59,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,and that was very reassuring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:51.47,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:55.23,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Did Lady Tiara say something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.23,0:08:57.59,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:59.31,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I don't have the right to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:06.01,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,The villainess is still involved, \Neven after the story is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:07.80,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:10.90,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I can't stand being locked up in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:14.87,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,How long must I wait \Nuntil I can be with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.08,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I think it's going to take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.83,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:22.87,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,And please tell me \Nall about Prince Aqua, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:24.85,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.13,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.61,0:09:28.77,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,After what Lady Tiara did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.82,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I want to save him \Nbefore he gets hurt, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:35.60,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights, time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.16,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Please don't go yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.81,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,His time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:42.56,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Wait, Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:48.26,Italics,Hartknights INT,0,0,0,,I may have made a mistake \Nthat can never be undone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The end of the graduation event
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:57.03,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,marked the end of all \Nthe game's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:59.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What's going to happen from here on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:04.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is the main character \Nin the sequel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:09.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't imagine a future in which I, \Nthe villainess, become his consort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If the sequel has its own heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:18.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua might have \Na change of heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.03,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Just like Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:41.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Good evening, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:44.09,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Isn't the moon beautiful tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:46.42,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But... why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I apologize for visiting so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know this is very sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:56.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but there's something \NI simply must show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:02.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you familiar \Nwith the Fairy Star Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I wanted to show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:06.91,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:19.03,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(774,686)\shad0\fnArial\fs20\c&H6F747F&\3c&HF7F9F9&\t(1,11117,1 \fs11)\move(324,257,221,195,65,11117)}The Fairy Star Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:10.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The Fairy Star Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:13.40,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's an event in one episode \Nof {\i0}The Ring of Lapis Lazuli{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:17.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,that the heroine gets to see \Nwith the character she's closest to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:21.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But this isn't the season for that, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:23.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come, fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We can't have you catching a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:34.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:39.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But now you might catch a cold yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:42.10,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I've trained my body well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:44.09,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'm being a bit coercive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:47.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:48.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:50.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:52.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:58.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, what to do? I'm very happy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:02.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I almost feel as if I'm doing \Nsomething I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:21.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Wow! It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:23.98,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:36.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm glad you enjoyed it, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:41.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His golden eyes look like stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I feel like they're sucking me in...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:51.92,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:58.96,Default,King,0,0,0,,Hartknights, I hear \Nyou visited Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:03.01,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I apologize for acting on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:06.52,Default,King,0,0,0,,And did you gain anything from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:12.69,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I realized that I believed what Akari \Nsaid without even questioning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:15.11,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I should have listened more \Nto Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:18.99,Default,King,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:19.95,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:24.78,Default,King,0,0,0,,I apologized to her \Nfor the terrible time she had,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.29,Default,King,0,0,0,,but she didn't blame you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:33.29,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,{\fad(726,1)}I should have spoken more \Nwith Prince Hartknights as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:36.25,Default,King,0,0,0,,You two used to talk \Nall the time, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:39.22,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.50,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:45.60,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,You mustn't run off during study period \Nand trouble our teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.12,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,Everyone trembles out of \Nnervousness at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.03,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,I'm trembling as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.81,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,Let's do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:56.11,Flashback,Tiararose FB,0,0,0,,Carry yourself with confidence! \NYou're the crown prince, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:14:00.24,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiara was constantly scolding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:04.84,Default,King,0,0,0,,Because her focus has always been \Non the future of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.99,Default,King,0,0,0,,Everything she said was out of concern \Nfor your future as the crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:13.86,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Yes. I had no idea Tiara \Ncared so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:17.25,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,And yet I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:22.51,Default,King,0,0,0,,Regret it as you might, the ending \Nof your engagement cannot be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:30.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Since I'm going out with a crown prince, \Nit's important to look glamorous,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:34.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but my outfit should also be inoffensive \Nno matter where we may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:37.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,White is nice, but maybe \NI should go with blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:43.99,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You're having so much fun, \NLady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.81,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It is your first date, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:53.32,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I never went \Non dates with Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.17,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It's a hair ornament made of coral,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:02.74,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,a specialty of Marinforest, \NPrince Aquasteed's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This seems like too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:07.16,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It looks lovely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:13.14,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,And His Highness is sure to be pleased \Nwhen he sees you wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.50,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My heart is pounding in my chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and my feet feel like they're floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:27.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've never felt like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:38.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I never knew such a \Nbeautiful place existed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:41.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:47.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I baked some madeleines and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.91,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Would you like to have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:52.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You made them? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:54.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:00.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:04.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love eating sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:06.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but I also love baking them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:09.82,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Delicious sweets bring happiness \Nto those who eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:14.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Those madeleines are one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They're light and airy, \Nbut perfectly moist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:21.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They pair well with tea, cocoa, \Nand so many other drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I once baked a whole basket full,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:29.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,then got absorbed in a book, and \Nbefore I knew it, the basket was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:34.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My maid, Philine, was in a panic, \Nsaying I'd eaten too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:40.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You truly do love sweets \Nand books, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:43.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh... That was rather \Nunseemly of me, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.27,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:49.03,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You are adorable when \Nyou're talking about sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I could listen to you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:54.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please don't spoil me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.08,Default,Aqua,0,0,0,,The cookies are delicious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:03.73,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Here. Open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:08.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is Prince Aquasteed the type \Nto do this kind of thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You look cute when you're eating, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:26.44,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Say, Lady Tiararose... \Nif you wouldn't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,May I call you Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:37.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.80,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:42.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, please call me Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:45.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:50.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I didn't feel anything when \NPrince Hartknights called me Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What am I to do? I'm so happy, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:18:02.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I-If we get this close, \Nhe'll notice that my heart is racing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.69,0:18:06.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His heart is racing, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:09.40,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I got a bit embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:12.09,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That was too sudden, wasn't it? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:16.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But, Tiara, you look like \Nyou're waiting to be kissed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:19.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:25.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I had planned to go on more dates \Nand take our time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:30.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,When you're right in front of me, \NI can't help wanting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:34.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, may I ask a favor of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:37.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, if it's something within my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:38.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Would you feed me a cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:42.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:53.17,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm feeding an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:57.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Your cookies have such a gentle flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.05,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I could keep eating them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you for saying so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:06.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Does the fact that you're wearing \Nthis hair ornament mean
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,that I can get my hopes up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:14.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I feel so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:24.39,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I don't know what will happen to me, \Nthe villainess, from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:28.74,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But if Prince Aqua \Nis so interested in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:35.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Father, I'd like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:39.28,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Of course. It's about \NPrince Aquasteed, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.24,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I know my daughter well enough to guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:44.65,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,You're willing to accept, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:48.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. Please allow me to, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:51.61,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I'll be sad to see my daughter \Nmarry into another kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:55.01,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,but seeing you happy and smiling \Nis what matters most to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.86,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Welcome, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:07.73,Default - Top,Elliot,0,0,0,,I am Elliot, Prince Aquasteed's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:07.73,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&HCE99E8&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(263,299)}Elliot
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.27,0:20:07.73,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&HD1DA92&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(263,299)}Elliot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:10.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry my visit was so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:12.87,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:16.50,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed \Nwas absolutely delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:17.99,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:21.03,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Lapis Lazuli is \Na wonderful country, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:24.28,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,The ornaments made there \Nare especially lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,We have some very talented \Ncraftsmen who work hard on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And Marinforest is abundant \Nin natural coral, pearls,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:33.69,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,and other jewels of the sea, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:36.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's every girl's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:38.05,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Thank you for saying so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:41.26,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed will be pleased as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:43.72,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:50.98,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiara, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:54.48,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Oh... Are you here \Nto see Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:56.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.81,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what happened \Nat the graduation party!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:04.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:09.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights, \Nplease raise your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.23,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:14.22,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A member of the royalty \Nmustn't bow to just anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:19.96,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You always did caution me \Nabout all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.76,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:28.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm so glad he understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:33.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm genuinely happy to see the character \NI loved in my past life back on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:35.91,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiara...
